{
  "name": "3 - Send Approved Email Replies",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky_setup_0",
      "name": "Sticky Note - SETUP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -688
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SETUP — do this first\n\nThis piece runs quietly every 15 minutes, checking Airtable for email drafts you've ticked \"Approved.\" The moment it finds one, it sends the real email to the customer — there is no second confirmation. The 15-minute poll interval is a deliberate safety buffer: if you tick the box by accident, you have a window to un-tick it before anything actually goes out. Don't shrink this interval without a reason.\n\n1. In Airtable, the \"Email Drafts Pending Approval\" table needs to exist first (built alongside Workflow 2) with these exact columns: Customer Email, Subject, Draft Body, Original Gmail Message ID, Original Gmail Thread ID, Approved (checkbox — only you ever tick this, no workflow writes it), Sent, Sent At, Send Error.\n2. Click every Airtable node below and set its Base + Table to the real ones. A placeholder value is pre-filled on purpose so this can never silently write to the wrong base — n8n auto-attaches an unrelated existing resource if a name is given with no real ID.\n3. Click every Airtable node and pick your Airtable Personal Access Token credential.\n4. Click the Gmail node and pick your Gmail OAuth2 credential — the same Google account Workflow 2 watches, so replies land as that inbox.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 1780,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "section_1_sticky_1",
      "name": "Section - 1. Poll for Approved, Unsent Drafts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -48,
        -368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Poll for Approved, Unsent Drafts\nEvery 15 minutes: pull every row where you've ticked Approved and Sent is still empty. Nothing here decides anything — it just finds the work waiting for it.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 780,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "section_2_sticky_2",
      "name": "Section - 2. Send Each One, Log the Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        768,
        -368
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Send Each One, Log the Result\nOne draft at a time. The reply lands in the original email thread because it uses the stored Gmail Message ID — n8n's Reply operation threads it automatically. On success: Sent + Sent At get written. On failure: only Send Error gets written, Sent stays unticked on purpose so the next poll (15 minutes later) retries this row automatically. Approved is never touched here — that checkbox belongs to you alone.",
        "height": 700,
        "width": 1180,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "poll_every_15_minutes_3",
      "name": "Poll Every 15 Minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 15
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "get_approved_unsent_drafts_4",
      "name": "Get Approved Unsent Drafts",
      "notes": "Gate: Approved ticked AND Sent not ticked. CREDENTIAL: pick your Airtable Personal Access Token here — left as a placeholder on purpose. BASE/TABLE: click in and set Base + Table to the real 'Email Drafts Pending Approval' table once it exists — a placeholder ID is pre-filled so this can never silently point at the wrong base.",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.airtable",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "position": [
        288,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "search",
        "base": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "appREPLACEWITHBASE",
          "cachedResultName": "AI Customer Support Agent"
        },
        "table": {
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "tblREPLACEWITHTABL",
          "cachedResultName": "Email Drafts Pending Approval"
        },
        "filterByFormula": "AND({Approved}=1, {Sent}!=1)",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "airtableTokenApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_ME",
          "name": "Airtable Personal Access Token"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "loop_over_drafts_5",
      "name": "Loop Over Drafts",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
